# Byte-for-byte fidelity.
#
# Every file listed in SHA256SUMS.txt / release_manifest.json must be stored
# with exactly the bytes that were sealed. Git's end-of-line normalisation
# would rewrite CSV and text content on checkout, and would even rewrite line
# breaks inside quoted CSV cells, so it is disabled globally here.
#
# No later rule in this file re-enables `text` or sets `eol=`. Do not add them
# for any published path.

* -text

# True binary formats: never diff, never merge, never convert.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
